00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:53.060
<v Barbara Clinkscales>Oh god, it's Tess. And they just got through shooting, so that means she had to be getting off the bus on 79th Street. Tess, did you hear the shooting?
<v Barbara Clinkscales>哦天哪，是泰丝。他们刚开完枪，那意味着她肯定是在第79街下的公车。泰丝，你听到枪声了吗？

