<v Barbara Clinkscales>上帝，再次感谢你。

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.640
<v Tess Clinkscales>She was praying for me?
<v Tess Clinkscales>她在为我祈祷？

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:16.370
<v Barbara Clinkscales>Yeah, I was praying. They was just shooting. You could have got caught up in that. Where are you just coming from?
<v Barbara Clinkscales>是的，我在祈祷。他们刚才开枪了。你可能被卷进去了。你刚从哪儿回来？

