<v Tess Clinkscales>The library.
<v Tess Clinkscales>图书馆。

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:20.720
<v Barbara Clinkscales>Come up close. I can't hear you.
<v Barbara Clinkscales>靠近点。我听不见你说话。

