<v Tess Clinkscales>No.
<v Tess Clinkscales>不用。

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:54.790
<v Barbara Clinkscales>So you get up on your own?
<v Barbara Clinkscales>所以你是自己起床的？

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.520
<v Tess Clinkscales>Give me a Tasmanian alarm clock. That's what I want.
<v Tess Clinkscales>给我一个塔斯马尼亚闹钟吧。那就是我想要的。

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:13.330
<v Barbara Clinkscales>OK, her name is Tess. And they call her Taz. So she loves Tasmania, anything with Tasmania. If you come over and you see her room, she have Tasmania posters, Tasmania blankets, pillows, clothes.
<v Barbara Clinkscales>好的，她的名字是泰丝。他们叫她Taz。所以她喜欢塔斯马尼亚，任何带有塔斯马尼亚的东西。如果你过来看看她的房间，她有塔斯马尼亚海报、毛毯、枕头、衣服。

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:26.980
<v Tess Clinkscales>Underwear, socks, pictures.
<v Tess Clinkscales>内衣、袜子、照片。

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:38.720
<v Barbara Clinkscales>Tess have so many of my ways. She eat like me. She think like me. She dress like me. And these are things that just come natural, not things that I teach her. It just come natural.
<v Barbara Clinkscales>泰丝有很多我的习惯。她吃东西像我。思考方式像我。穿衣风格像我。这些都是自然而然形成的，不是我教她的。这是与生俱来的。

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.370
<v Gerald Clinkscales>Is this for me?
<v Gerald Clinkscales>这是给我的吗？

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.720
